        <mxCell id="tier2_c2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 13.5px;&quot;&gt;Interface Chuáº©n HÃ³a IsolatedRunner (Law 23)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin: 4px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;â€¢ Contract TypeScript: &lt;code&gt;executeJob(input): Promise&amp;lt;Result&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;â€¢ In: &lt;i&gt;imageDigest, command[], tenantBindingRef, limits&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;â€¢ Out: &lt;i&gt;exitCode, rawResultPath, logsPath, sha256Digest&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #2e7d32; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;âž” Chuáº©n hÃ³a giao tiáº¿p 100% Ä‘á»™c láº­p háº¡ táº§ng&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#90caf9;fontColor=#212121;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="tier2_box">
